{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_bard": {
        "skill2": "【避墙版】<#ff9028ff>游神圣坛<>：向交战中的友方英雄（或自己）投出圣坛，治疗<#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<>，移速+30%。<#ff9028ff>神奇旅程<>：被敌人近身时开门，带身边的友方英雄往己方后撤，出口避开石头，移速+40%（<#ffb900ff>16秒<>一次）。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_bard": {
        "skill2": "【避牆版】<#ff9028ff>守望神龕<>：向交戰中的友方英雄（或自己）投出神龕，治療<#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<>，跑速+30%。<#ff9028ff>奇幻旅程<>：被敵人近身時開門，帶身邊的友方英雄往己方後撤，出口避開石頭，跑速+40%（<#ffb900ff>16秒<>一次）。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_bard": {
        "skill2": "[Wall build] <#ff9028ff>Caretaker's Shrine<>: throws a shrine to an allied champion in a fight (or himself), healing <#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<> and giving 30% move speed. <#ff9028ff>Magical Journey<>: when enemies close in, opens a door back toward his side, clear of rock, and takes nearby allied champions with him, +40% move speed (every <#ffb900ff>16s<>)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_bard": {
        "skill2": "[벽 회피] <#ff9028ff>수호자의 성소<>: 교전 중인 아군 챔피언(또는 자신)에게 성소를 던져 <#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<> 회복, 이동 속도 +30%. <#ff9028ff>신비한 차원문<>: 적이 붙으면 아군 쪽으로 바위를 피해 문을 열어 주변 아군 챔피언과 함께 물러나고 이동 속도 +40% (<#ffb900ff>16초<>마다)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_bard": {
        "skill2": "【壁回避】<#ff9028ff>回復の遺物<>：交戦中の味方チャンピオン（か自分）に遺物を投げ<#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<>回復、移動速度+30%。<#ff9028ff>精霊の旅路<>：敵に詰められると岩を避けて自陣側へ扉を開き、近くの味方と離脱、移動速度+40%（<#ffb900ff>16秒<>ごと）。"
      }
    }
  }
}
